<%#
  One response, three panels — everything a render finishing changes, and nothing
  else.

  A frame can only reload itself, which is why the mode switcher used to sit stale
  with PREVIEW CUT disabled after the clips were already on disk. These three are
  targeted by id instead, so the update reaches outside the composition frame with
  no page visit and no frame navigation.

  Deliberately absent: the player (its iframe would be torn down and playback would
  restart) and the transcript (thousands of segments, resent every couple of
  seconds).
%>
<%= turbo_stream.replace "cut_composition" do %><%= render "cut" %><% end %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace "stage_modes" do %><%= render "stage_modes" %><% end %>
<%= turbo_stream.replace "stage_playback" do %><%= render "stage_playback" %><% end %>
